[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 133 Sensational",
    "start": 0.83,
    "end": 5.212,
    "zh": "第133课 轰动性的",
    "zh_hant": "第133課 轟動性的"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "news!",
    "start": 4.862,
    "end": 5.833,
    "zh": "新闻！",
    "zh_hant": "新聞！"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "Listen to the tape then",
    "start": 6.873,
    "end": 9.835,
    "zh": "听录音，然后",
    "zh_hant": "聽錄音，然後"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "answer this question.",
    "start": 9.655,
    "end": 11.616,
    "zh": "回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "What reasons did Karen Marsh give",
    "start": 12.616,
    "end": 16.398,
    "zh": "凯伦·马什给出了什么理由",
    "zh_hant": "凱倫·馬什給出了什麼理由"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "for wanting to retire?",
    "start": 16.158,
    "end": 18.579,
    "zh": "想要退休？",
    "zh_hant": "想要退休？"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "Have you just made a new film, Miss Marsh?",
    "start": 20.82,
    "end": 24.802,
    "zh": "马什小姐，你刚拍完一部新电影吗？",
    "zh_hant": "馬什小姐，你剛拍完一部新電影嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "Yes, I have.",
    "start": 25.303,
    "end": 27.623,
    "zh": "是的，拍完了。",
    "zh_hant": "是的，拍完了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "Are you going to make another?",
    "start": 28.084,
    "end": 30.605,
    "zh": "你打算再拍一部吗？",
    "zh_hant": "你打算再拍一部嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "No, I'm not.",
    "start": 30.825,
    "end": 33.026,
    "zh": "不，不拍了。",
    "zh_hant": "不，不拍了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "I'm going to retire.",
    "start": 33.287,
    "end": 35.788,
    "zh": "我打算退休。",
    "zh_hant": "我打算退休。"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "I feel very tired.",
    "start": 36.328,
    "end": 38.909,
    "zh": "我感到很累。",
    "zh_hant": "我感到很累。"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "I don't want to make another film",
    "start": 39.209,
    "end": 42.431,
    "zh": "我不想再拍电影",
    "zh_hant": "我不想再拍電影"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "for a long time.",
    "start": 42.552,
    "end": 45.093,
    "zh": "很长一段时间。",
    "zh_hant": "很長一段時間。"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "Let's buy a newspaper, Liz.",
    "start": 46.433,
    "end": 49.575,
    "zh": "我们买份报纸吧，莉兹。",
    "zh_hant": "我們買份報紙吧，莉茲。"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "Listen to this!",
    "start": 50.295,
    "end": 52.176,
    "zh": "听这个！",
    "zh_hant": "聽這個！"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "'Karen Marsh: Sensational News!",
    "start": 52.697,
    "end": 57.138,
    "zh": "'凯伦·马什：轰动性新闻！",
    "zh_hant": "'凱倫·馬什：轟動性新聞！"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "By our reporter, Alan Jones.",
    "start": 57.359,
    "end": 61.18,
    "zh": "本报记者艾伦·琼斯报道。",
    "zh_hant": "本報記者艾倫·瓊斯報道。"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "Karen Marsh arrived at London Airport",
    "start": 62.201,
    "end": 66.323,
    "zh": "凯伦·马什抵达伦敦机场",
    "zh_hant": "凱倫·馬什抵達倫敦機場"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "today.",
    "start": 66.183,
    "end": 67.183,
    "zh": "今天。",
    "zh_hant": "今天。"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "She was wearing a blue dress",
    "start": 67.824,
    "end": 71.105,
    "zh": "她穿着一件蓝色连衣裙",
    "zh_hant": "她穿著一件藍色連衣裙"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "and a mink coat.",
    "start": 71.146,
    "end": 73.306,
    "zh": "和一件貂皮大衣。",
    "zh_hant": "和一件貂皮大衣。"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "She told me she had just",
    "start": 73.847,
    "end": 76.928,
    "zh": "她告诉我她刚",
    "zh_hant": "她告訴我她剛"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "made a new film.",
    "start": 76.668,
    "end": 78.909,
    "zh": "拍完一部新电影。",
    "zh_hant": "拍完一部新電影。"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "she said she was not going to make",
    "start": 79.75,
    "end": 83.693,
    "zh": "她说她不打算再拍",
    "zh_hant": "她說她不打算再拍"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "text": "another.",
    "start": 83.474,
    "end": 84.534,
    "zh": "另一部了。",
    "zh_hant": "另一部了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 26,
    "text": "She said she was going to retire.",
    "start": 85.916,
    "end": 89.798,
    "zh": "她说她打算退休。",
    "zh_hant": "她說她打算退休。"
  },
  {
    "index": 27,
    "text": "She told reporters she felt",
    "start": 90.479,
    "end": 93.722,
    "zh": "她告诉记者们她感到",
    "zh_hant": "她告訴記者們她感到"
  },
  {
    "index": 28,
    "text": "very tired and didn't",
    "start": 93.462,
    "end": 96.304,
    "zh": "非常累，并且不",
    "zh_hant": "非常累，並且不"
  },
  {
    "index": 29,
    "text": "want to make another film",
    "start": 96.004,
    "end": 98.666,
    "zh": "想再拍另一部电影",
    "zh_hant": "想再拍另一部電影"
  },
  {
    "index": 30,
    "text": "for a long time.'",
    "start": 98.726,
    "end": 101.668,
    "zh": "很长一段时间。'",
    "zh_hant": "很長一段時間。'"
  },
  {
    "index": 31,
    "text": "I wonder why!",
    "start": 102.169,
    "end": 103.95,
    "zh": "我想知道为什么！",
    "zh_hant": "我想知道為什麼！"
  }
]
